@startuml

title Payment & Transfer - System Context

actor Customer

rectangle "Client Application" as Client
rectangle "Transfer Service\n(Orchestrator)" as Transfer
database "Operations DB" as DB
rectangle "Core Banking System" as ABS
rectangle "Payment Processing Network" as PSP
rectangle "Audit Service" as Audit
rectangle "Operations Console" as Ops

Customer --> Client : Initiate transfer
Client --> Transfer : Transfer request

Transfer --> DB : Persist operation state
Transfer --> ABS : Banking operation
Transfer --> PSP : Payment request
Transfer --> Audit : Audit events

PSP --> Transfer : Processing result

Ops --> Transfer : Investigate / reconcile

@enduml
